{"_note":"参数编辑页的 App 选单(xbridge.runDataFlow('apps-list'))。定长 8 槽,不透传 r.data。\n【G23 豁免】用户主动进配置页才跑(§5.5.11 P3:低频、用户主动等)。","version":1,"actions":[{"id":"csq","action":"credential.state","params":{"id":"asc"},"_note":"凭证闸第一步:纯本地查表,零网络。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_bcs","value":"1"},"_note":"屏障(勿删):credential.state 之后紧邻的节点读不到它的结果。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"csB","value":"$[if::(eq::(${csq.state},bound),1,0)]"},"_note":"1 = 已绑 `asc`;0 = 没绑 / 已失效 → 下面带凭证的请求一律不发。"},{"id":"cred","action":"credential.state","params":{"id":"asc"},"_note":"凭证绑定状态(纯本地查表,零网络)。cred_triage() 的 `credOk` 据此分档:\n  fail=1 且 credOk=1 → 真的是网络没拿到答案 → 抛错回落上次成功数据;\n  fail=1 且 credOk=0 → 密钥不在(没绑/被删)→ 不抛,卡上显示「需要密钥」。"},{"_note":"凭证闸(gen_appstore.py 出口改写,appstore-merged §13):没绑 `asc` 就不发这个请求。`required:false` 时宿主不拦,不包这一层就会匿名打 ASC 拿 401。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${csB},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"id":"r","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/apps?limit=8&sort=name","method":"GET","formatType":"json","credential":"asc"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"errMsg","value":"$[get::(index::(${r.errors},0),detail)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(eq::(${r},),0,if::(gt::(length::(${errMsg}),0),0,1))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"SRXT","value":{"d":".*\\((401|403)\\).*"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"emT0","value":""}},{"action":"concurrent","items":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"emT0","value":"${@r.errorMsg}"}}],"_note":"⚠️ 勿删、勿挪:HTTP 状态只能在并发子域里从 `@id.errorMsg` 认。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_cT","value":"1"},"_note":"并发屏障(勿删)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"denied","value":"$[if::(matches::(${emT0},${SRXT.d}),1,0)]"},"_note":"1 = 服务端明确拒绝(401/403):这把密钥的角色看不到这块数据。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"errCode","value":"$[get::(index::(${r.errors},0),status)]"},"_note":"服务端给的 HTTP 状态码(errors[0].status,如 401/403),渲染层贴在「被拒」后作分诊线索。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"errCode","value":"$[if::(eq::(${denied},1),403,${errCode})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"fail","value":"$[if::(eq::(${denied},1),2,if::(gt::(length::(${errMsg}),0),if::(eq::(${errCode},401),2,if::(eq::(${errCode},403),2,1)),if::(eq::(${r},),1,0)))]"},"_note":"失败分档:0=正常 · 1=没拿到答案 · 2=密钥被拒(只认 401/403;429/5xx 是瞬时故障归 1)。\n判据:有 errors 体 = 请求到过服务端;响应为空 = 压根没发出去(凭证注入器取不到密钥本体时是抛错不发请求,而 AF 节点失败不升级流失败,于是流照报 success、响应为空)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"credOk","value":"$[if::(eq::(${cred.state},bound),1,0)]"},"_note":"「这个包**现在**有没有可用的凭证」—— 查绑定表,删凭证 / 换设备当场归 0。(旧判据 `ever` 是推出来的、单调不可逆,删掉凭证后恒为 1。)"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${fail},1),${credOk},0)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"App Store Connect fetch failed"}}],"_note":"只在「没拿到答案且凭证在」时抛 —— 那才是网络抖动,旧数据比一屏 `--` 强;被拒(fail=2)/ 没绑(credOk=0)是明确答案,交给 RCN 渲。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"total","value":"$[length::(${r.data})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"list","value":[{"n":"${r.data[0].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},0),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},0),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[1].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},1),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},1),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[2].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},2),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},2),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[3].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},3),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},3),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[4].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},4),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},4),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[5].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},5),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},5),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[6].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},6),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},6),attributes),bundleId)]"},{"n":"${r.data[7].attributes.name}","id":"$[get::(index::(${r.data},7),id)]","b":"$[get::(get::(index::(${r.data},7),attributes),bundleId)]"}]},"_note":"App 名自由文本 ${} 明文直取;bundleId 是 com.x.y 形态,进方法安全。"},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["ok","errMsg","total","list","fail","errCode","credOk","csB"]}}],"_lintCache":"exempt"}
